---
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const title = "Development Log: Game and Shock";
---

<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
        <title>{`{title} - Iridesce`}</title>
    </head>
    <body>
        <Header />

        <main style="max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem;">
            <article style="max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem;">
                <h1>{`{title}`}</h1>
                <p>A behind-the-scenes look at making an arcade game about defending monuments.</p>

                <hr style="margin:2rem 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;" />

                <section class="blog-section">
                    <h2>The Concept</h2>
                    <p>"Game and Shock" is an arcade-style game where you control a shield protecting ancient monuments from invaders.</p>
                </section>

                <section class="blog-section">
                    <h2>Development Progress</h2>
                    <ul style="margin-left:1.5rem;margin-top:1rem;">
                        <li><strong>Phase 1:</strong> Basic gameplay mechanics</li>
                        <li><strong>Phase 2:</strong> Power-ups and enemies</li>
                        <li><strong>Phase 3:</strong> Sound design and polish</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>

                <hr style="margin:2rem 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;" />

                <section class="blog-section">
                    <h2>The Game</h2>
                    <p><a href="https://fainspirit.itch.io/game-and-shock" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Play now on itch.io!</a></p>
                </section>

                <hr style="margin:2rem 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;" />

                <section class="blog-section">
                    <h2>Next Steps</h2>
                    <p>Coming soon: New levels, harder enemies, and secret power-ups!</p>
                </section>
            </article>
        </main>

        <Footer />
    </body>
</html>
